<title>SWEDEN: Sweden's Swedbank to merge with Foreningsbanken.</title>
<headline>Sweden's Swedbank to merge with Foreningsbanken.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's Swedbank said on Tuesday it is to merge with Foreningsbanken with the new bank to be called ForeningsSparbanken.</p>
<p>Swedbank, which is known in Sweden as Sparbanken Sverige, said trading in the two banks, that was suspended early Monday, would resume at 1400 GMT on Tuesday.</p>
